# Pooja Fashion Backend - Project Setup

## 1) Install dependencies
npm install

## 2) Recommended package setup
# Production dependencies
npm install express cors dotenv helmet morgan cookie-parser multer bcryptjs jsonwebtoken express-rate-limit zod dayjs uuid pino pino-http node-cron compression http-errors swagger-jsdoc swagger-ui-express pg

# Development dependencies
npm install -D nodemon eslint prettier jest supertest

## 3) Important rules
# Use only one of each:
# - bcryptjs (not bcrypt)
# - zod (not joi)
# - pino (not winston)
# - pg (if using PostgreSQL) or mysql2 (if using MySQL)

## 4) Project scripts
# package.json scripts should be:
# "dev": "nodemon src/server.js"
# "start": "node src/server.js"
# "test": "jest --runInBand"
# "lint": "eslint ."

## 5) Sample .env values
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:admin@localhost:5432/pooja_fashion
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=your_access_secret_here
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your_refresh_secret_here
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES_IN=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE=5242880
LOG_LEVEL=info

## 6) Basic backend stack
# - Express
# - PostgreSQL (pg)
# - Zod validation
# - JWT auth
# - Pino logging
# - Helmet + CORS + rate limiting
# - Multer for uploads
# - Dayjs for dates
# - UUID for IDs
# - Compression + http-errors
# - Swagger docs
# - Jest + Supertest for tests

## 7) Final recommendation
# Keep this setup clean:
# 1 database driver
# 1 validation library
# 1 logger
# 1 password hashing library

# Best combination for this project:
# - pg
# - zod
# - pino
# - bcryptjs

16. Final package categories

Your project will look like this:

| Package              | Purpose                 |
| -------------------- | ----------------------- |
| `express`            | Web/API framework       |
| `mysql2`             | MySQL connection        |
| `dotenv`             | Environment variables   |
| `cors`               | Cross-origin requests   |
| `helmet`             | Security headers        |
| `morgan`             | HTTP logging            |
| `pino`               | Application logging     |
| `pino-http`          | HTTP logging with Pino  |
| `cookie-parser`      | Read cookies            |
| `multer`             | File uploads            |
| `bcryptjs`           | Password hashing        |
| `jsonwebtoken`       | JWT authentication      |
| `express-rate-limit` | Rate limiting           |
| `zod`                | Validation              |
| `dayjs`              | Date/time               |
| `uuid`               | UUID generation         |
| `node-cron`          | Scheduled jobs          |
| `compression`        | Response compression    |
| `http-errors`        | HTTP/application errors |
| `swagger-jsdoc`      | OpenAPI generation      |
| `swagger-ui-express` | Swagger UI              |
| `nodemon`            | Development             |
| `eslint`             | Code quality            |
| `prettier`           | Formatting              |
| `jest`               | Testing                 |
| `supertest`          | API testing             |
